Name: libtorrent-rasterbar
URL: https://www.libtorrent.org/
Version: 2.1.1
License: BSD-3-Clause, APSL-2.0
License File: LICENSE, UPSTREAM_LICENSE.txt, APSL-2.0.txt, SOURCE_OFFER.txt
