Description:
Optional macOS torrent integration. Source provenance remains documented in
README.aegis; adding credit metadata does not qualify it for production release.
The complete upstream LICENSE preserves the macOS routing-header notices.
The corresponding original header accompanies the staged App as described in SOURCE_OFFER.txt.

